    { "type": "web-project", "size": "major", "category": "web",
    "title": "PAP Media Monitoring",
    "shortDescription": "UX optimization, interface redesign, and branding support for the PAP Media Monitoring platform, focused on improving navigation, search workflows, and product communication across digital and print channels",
    "description": "For the PAP Media Monitoring project, I was responsible for improving the overall user experience of the existing platform interface. The project focused on enhancing usability, streamlining key workflows, and increasing the visibility and accessibility of core features. \n\nMy responsibilities included: \n• Redesigning the information architecture and introducing clearer labeling for key navigation elements \n• Optimizing the user flow within the search functionality to improve efficiency and ease of use \n• Developing a new approach to saving and sharing content across the platform \n• Designing branding and external communication materials for the product \n• Creating digital and print advertising assets, landing pages, and product brochures \n\nThe project combined UX strategy, interface optimization, and marketing communication to create a more intuitive user experience while strengthening the product’s visual presence across multiple channels.",
    "thumb": "images/thumbs/web2.jpg.webp",
    "tags": ["UI Design", "UX", "Branding", "Advertising"],
    "screens": ["images/thumbs/web2-s1.jpg.webp", "images/thumbs/web2-s2.jpg.webp", "images/thumbs/web2-s3.jpg.webp"],
    "links": [
      { "label": "View the site", "url": "https://monitoring.pap.pl/" }
    ]
  },
  
  { "type": "web-project", "size": "major", "category": "web",
    "title": "PAP Biznes Real Estate Module",
    "shortDescription": "UI design and UX consultation for a dedicated real estate section within the PAP Business platform, created in partnership with JLL",
    "description": "As part of a partnership project between PAP and JLL, I was responsible for designing a new, dedicated real estate section for the full version of the PAP Business platform. I also led the visual redesign and enhancement of selected interface elements across the PAP Business website.\n\nMy responsibilities included:\n• Creating wireframes and the final visual design of the new module\n• Providing UX consultation and guidance throughout every stage of the project\n• Designing promotional and marketing graphics supporting the launch\n\nThe project focused on delivering a clear, user-friendly experience while introducing a distinctive visual identity for real estate-related content within the platform.",
    "thumb": "images/thumbs/web1.jpg.webp",
    "tags": ["UI Design", "UX", "Advertising"],
    "screens": ["images/thumbs/web1-s1.jpg.webp", "images/thumbs/web1-s2.png.webp", "images/thumbs/web1-s3.png.webp"],
    "links": [
      { "label": "View the site", "url": "https://biznes.pap.pl/kategoria/nieruchomosci" }
    ]
  },

  { "type": "web-project", "size": "major", "category": "web",
    "title": "ZdrowieGo",
    "shortDescription": "Website design, branding, and visual identity for the ZdrowieGO medical platform, combining INFOR's design standards with a distinctive visual language",
    "description": "For the ZdrowieGO medical platform, I was responsible for creating the website layout, branding, logo, and complete visual identity. The project focused on establishing a distinctive and approachable brand while maintaining consistency with the broader INFOR ecosystem. \n\nMy responsibilities included: \n• Designing the website layout and user interface \n• Creating the brand identity, logo, and visual guidelines \n• Developing a unique visual language based on a dedicated color palette and rounded design elements \n• Highlighting the platform’s key content areas, with a particular focus on health-related legal and financial topics \n• Introducing a new approach to journalist attribution and author presentation \n\nThe project combined digital product design and brand development to create a recognizable online presence while strengthening the platform’s editorial positioning within the health information market.",
    "thumb": "images/thumbs/web3.jpg.webp",
    "tags": ["UI Design", "Logo Design", "Branding"],
    "screens": ["images/thumbs/web3-s1.jpg.webp", "images/thumbs/web3-s2.jpg.webp", "images/thumbs/web3-s3.jpg.webp"],
    "links": [
            { "label": "View the site", "url": "https://www.zdrowiego.pl/" }
    ]
  },

